WEBVTT

00:01:28.376 --> 00:01:32.213
and also eating a diet
that contains high amounts of sugar

00:01:32.213 --> 00:01:34.257
and low amounts of fiber,

00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:38.803
are all associated with significantly
worse sleep quantity

00:01:38.803 --> 00:01:40.346
and sleep quality.

00:01:40.555 --> 00:01:44.183
The good news here is that we can
think of sleep as a new tool

00:01:44.183 --> 00:01:46.561
to help regulate our body weight.

00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:48.104
And as a result,

00:01:48.104 --> 00:01:50.273
improve our overall health

00:01:50.273 --> 00:01:51.858
and our wellness.